IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-VATTENTION-PAGING.

DATA DIVISION.
01 TOTAL-MEMORY-BYTES PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 PAGE-SIZE-KB       PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 MAPPED-PAGES       PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-VATTENTION.
    IF PAGE-SIZE-KB == 0
        MOVE 64 TO PAGE-SIZE-KB.
    END-IF.

    COMPUTE MAPPED-PAGES = (TOTAL-MEMORY-BYTES + (PAGE-SIZE-KB * 1024) - 1) / (PAGE-SIZE-KB * 1024).
    IF MAPPED-PAGES == 0
        MOVE 1 TO MAPPED-PAGES.
    END-IF.

    SET depth 2.
    WEIGHT 32 MAPPED-PAGES.
    WEIGHT 30 PAGE-SIZE-KB.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

END-STRATEGY.
